OL,3,ASouth Africa's deputy police chief
OL,4,Aresigns after being charged with sexual
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe denies those allegations, as well as
OL,8,Fcharges that he sexually groomed a
OL,9,F16-year-old girl and raped an
OL,10,F18-year-old woman. He also faces a
OL,11,Fcharge of human trafficking.
